1
00:00:00,461 --> 00:00:04,841
(Howard:)That's kind of an overreaction
to a little harmless necrophilia.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,180
(Leonard:)It's not you, Howard.
He says he's moving out.

3
00:00:09,595 --> 00:00:11,305
(Raj:)What did you do?

4
00:00:11,472 --> 00:00:14,852
(Raj:)Did you change the contrast
or brightness settings on the television?

5
00:00:15,017 --> 00:00:16,647
(Leonard:)- No.
- Did you take a Band-Aid off...

6
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:18,600
(Raj:)...in front of him?

7
00:00:18,771 --> 00:00:20,691
(Leonard:)- No.
- Did you buy generic ketchup?

8
00:00:20,856 --> 00:00:24,316
Forget to rinse the sink?
Talk to him through the bathroom door?

9
00:00:25,736 --> 00:00:29,406
Adjust the thermostat? Cook with cilantro?
Pronounce the T in "often"?

10
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:32,073
(Leonard:)No.

11
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:35,700
(Howard:)Did you make fun of trains?

12
00:00:37,664 --> 00:00:40,914
(Leonard:)I didn't do anything.
He's just gone insane.

13
00:00:41,084 --> 00:00:43,004
(Raj:)Well, we all knew this day was coming.

14
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:46,630
(Leonard:)That was fast.

15
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:49,799
(Sheldon:)It's my pre-packed
disaster evacuation bag.

16
00:00:51,094 --> 00:00:54,054
It's recommended by
the Department of Homeland Security.

17
00:00:54,223 --> 00:00:57,023
(Sheldon:)And Sarah Connor.

